su text "sense-lemma:n:90004801-n:1" ob text "everything" ya
su text "sense-gloss:r:00005103-r" ob text "and nothing more; I was merely asking; it is simply a matter of time; just a scratch; he was only a child; hopes that last but a moment" ya
