su text "sense-lemma:r:00005103-r:5" ob text "simply" ya
su text "sense-gloss:r:00008102-r" ob text "to some extent; in some degree; not wholly; I felt partly to blame; He was partially paralyzed" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00008102-r:1" ob text "in part" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00008102-r:2" ob text "part" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00008102-r:3" ob text "partially" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00008102-r:4" ob text "partly" ya
su text "sense-gloss:r:00021667-r" ob text "sporadically and infrequently; he was arrogant and occasionally callous; open areas are only occasionally interrupted by clumps of trees; they visit New York on occasion; now and again she would take her favorite book from the shelf and read to us; as we drove along, the beautiful scenery now and then attracted his attention" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00021667-r:1" ob text "at times" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00021667-r:2" ob text "from time to time" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00021667-r:3" ob text "now and again" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00021667-r:4" ob text "now and then" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00021667-r:5" ob text "occasionally" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00021667-r:6" ob text "on occasion" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00021667-r:7" ob text "once in a while" ya
su text "sense-gloss:r:00026137-r" ob text "to or in any or all places; pronoun, location; quantifier: universal; You find fast food stores everywhere; people everywhere are becoming aware of the problem; he carried a gun everywhere he went; looked all over for a suitable gift" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00026137-r:1" ob text "all over" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00026137-r:2" ob text "everyplace" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00026137-r:3" ob text "everywhere" ya
su text "sense-gloss:r:00026948-r" ob text "used to indicate that a statement explains or supports a previous statement; Anyhow, he is dead now; I think they're asleep; anyhow, they're quiet; I don't know what happened to it; anyway, it's gone; anyway, there is another factor to consider; I don't know how it started; in any case, there was a brief scuffle; in any event, the government faced a serious protest; but at any rate he got a knighthood for it" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00026948-r:1" ob text "anyhow" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00026948-r:2" ob text "anyway" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00026948-r:3" ob text "anyways" ya
