su text "sense-lemma:r:00026948-r:5" ob text "in any case" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00026948-r:6" ob text "in any event" ya
su text "sense-gloss:r:00027761-r" ob text "despite anything to the contrary (usually preceding a concession); although I'm a little afraid, however I'd like to try it; while we disliked each other, nevertheless we agreed; he was a stern yet fair master; granted that it is dangerous, all the same I still want to go" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00027761-r:1" ob text "all the same" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00027761-r:2" ob text "at the same time" ya
su text "sense-lemma:r:00027761-r:3" ob text "even so" ya
